@startuml
title Smart Housing Services - Draft Component Diagram

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "User interface" {
  component "Web Application\nResident, Dispatcher and Service Staff views" as Web
}

package "Backend Application" {
  component "Application API\nAuthentication and access control" as API
  component "Request Management\nSubmission, assignments and statuses" as Requests
  component "Text Classification\nCategory recommendation" as Classifier
  component "Service Routing\nService recommendation" as Routing
  component "Audit History\nChange records" as Audit
}

database "Application Database\nUsers, requests, services,\nrouting rules and history" as DB

artifact "Trained Model\nText vectorizer, classifier\nand category labels" as Model

Web --> API : HTTPS / JSON
API --> Requests : Authorised operations
API --> DB : User and role lookup

Requests --> DB : Save and retrieve requests
Requests --> Classifier : Request text
Classifier --> Model : Load inference artifacts

Requests --> Routing : Category and address
Routing --> DB : Read service directory\nand routing rules

Requests --> Audit : Record changes
Audit --> DB : Store history

note right of Requests
  Category and service outputs are recommendations.
  Assignment requires dispatcher confirmation.

  Classification failure preserves the request
  and flags it for manual review.
end note

note bottom of Model
  Model training and evaluation are performed
  separately from normal request processing.
end note

note bottom of DB
  Initial prototype uses a demonstration
  service directory and non-sensitive test data.
end note

@enduml
